{{!
    @template mod_booking/slotbooking/slot_grid_day

    Proportional shared timeline for the fixed-grid (calendar) booking interface: every lane (one
    per merged booking option - see slot_day_renderers.js) shares the same absolute time axis, so
    slots at the same real time line up across lanes instead of just being stacked in whatever
    order they happen to sort into. Buffer separators are drawn to scale too. The
    condition/slotBooking picker builds the lane/tick/block lists and wires the click handlers;
    this template only renders the markup.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * heightpx - Pixel height of the shared timeline (the label column and every lane share this).
    * ticks - Array of { top, label } - shared time-axis marks, top in percent from the top.
    * lanes - Array of { blocks }, one per lane, left to right (see slot_day_renderers.js for the
      per-option grouping and lane ordering).
        * blocks - Slot rows and buffer separators for this lane, positioned absolutely (top/
          height in percent of the shared timeline) rather than stacked.
            * key - Slot key "start:end" (buffer separators use a synthetic "buffer:..." key).
            * statusclass - Modifier class (booking-slot--available|--selected|--booked|--buffer).
            * buffer - True for a buffer separator: renders as a plain block with no header/
              content, drawn to scale, and is skipped by the click handler (see slot_day_renderers.js).
            * top - Top offset in percent of the shared timeline height.
            * height - Height in percent of the shared timeline height.
            * time - Time range label, e.g. "16:00 - 16:20". Only used when not buffer.
            * booked - Whether the slot is already booked.
            * bookedlabel - Label shown on booked slots.
            * priceformatted - Formatted price, empty when no price applies.
            * teachers - Teacher summary string, empty when none.
            * color - CSS color for the multi-option left-border accent, empty when not applicable
              (buffer separators and single-option calendars never carry a color).
            * manageurl - URL to the slot's own booking option page, only set when the slot is
              booked AND that option is currently cancelable by the user; empty otherwise.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "heightpx": 240,
        "ticks": [{"top": 0, "label": "07:00"}, {"top": 50, "label": "08:00"}],
        "lanes": [
            {"blocks": [
                {"key": "1620:1640", "statusclass": "booking-slot--available", "buffer": false, "top": 10, "height": 20, "time": "16:00 - 16:20", "booked": false, "bookedlabel": "Booked", "priceformatted": "", "teachers": "", "color": "#0d6efd"}
            ]}
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="booking-slot-timeline-wrapper--scroll">
    <div class="booking-slot-timeline-axis d-flex align-items-stretch" style="height: {{heightpx}}px;">
        <div class="booking-slot-timeline-labels position-relative flex-shrink-0" style="height: {{heightpx}}px;">
            {{#ticks}}
                <div class="booking-slot-timeline-label position-absolute" style="top: {{top}}%;">{{label}}</div>
            {{/ticks}}
        </div>
        <div class="booking-slot-timeline-lanes d-flex flex-row align-items-stretch flex-grow-1">
            {{#lanes}}
                <div class="booking-slot-timeline booking-slot-timeline--fixed booking-slot-timeline--clickable position-relative"
                     style="height: {{heightpx}}px;">
                    {{#ticks}}
                        <div class="booking-slot-timeline-tick position-absolute" style="top: {{top}}%;"></div>
                    {{/ticks}}
                    {{#blocks}}
                        <div class="booking-slot {{statusclass}} position-absolute"
                             data-slot-key="{{key}}" data-option-id="{{optionid}}" {{#booked}}data-booked="1"{{/booked}}
                             style="top: {{top}}%; height: {{height}}%;{{#color}} border-left: 4px solid {{color}};{{/color}}">
                            {{^buffer}}
                                <div class="booking-slot-header">
                                    <div class="booking-slot-time">{{time}}</div>
                                    {{#priceformatted}}<div class="booking-slot-price">{{priceformatted}}</div>{{/priceformatted}}
                                </div>
                                {{#booked}}
                                    <div class="booking-slot-badge-row">
                                        {{#manageurl}}
                                            <a href="{{manageurl}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="booking-slot-badge booking-slot-badge--link">{{bookedlabel}}</a>
                                        {{/manageurl}}
                                        {{^manageurl}}
                                            <div class="booking-slot-badge">{{bookedlabel}}</div>
                                        {{/manageurl}}
                                    </div>
                                {{/booked}}
                                {{#teachers}}<div class="booking-slot-teachers">{{teachers}}</div>{{/teachers}}
                            {{/buffer}}
                        </div>
                    {{/blocks}}
                </div>
            {{/lanes}}
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
